    - target: {fileID: 1055181619058526144, guid: 0831d9e881ba7744a80631df26f218cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This game was created as part of the LoGaCulture project by Bournemouth
        University, University of Southampton, and University of Bristol, alongside
        the National Trust, and funded by the UKRI and European Commission.


        Please
        play safely, respect the historic environment, and be mindful of others -
        do not use your device near the roads, cross carefully, be careful walking
        on uneven ground, and ensure that your play does not alarm livestock or disturb
        people enjoying Avebury around you.


        Note that this game may present
        a historical understanding of the nature and history of the Avebury site,
        but as part of a fictional story. The factual history of ancient sites is
        often unclear and ambiguous.


        This game may log anonymous data with
        regards to your usage, but not personal or identifiable information. By playing
        this game you consent to this data being used anonymously for research purposes
        - more information on the LoGaCulture research project at Avebury can be
        found here: https://logaculture.eu/case-study-1/.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
